  "description": {
   "en": "To kill time, high school girls made up the *seven school wonders*, a set of bizarre legends. \"If you can cross the edge of the school roof blindfolded, your wish will come true. However, if you fall down, you will die.\" But a sacrifice is needed to make the story seem real... The girls' daily lives are side by side with cold hands of death! \n\n***★White Flames***\n- Horror M • 12/2003\n***★Mother of Kijin***\n- Horror M • 05/2004\n***★The Suite***\n- Horror M • 06/2004\n***★Borderline***\n- Horror M • 08/2004\n***★A Marionette's Sight***\n- Horror M • 10/2004"
